DESCRIPTION:An overcomplicated project increases development and maintenanc
 e time.\nIf a complete redesign is not possible\, we can try to distribute
  the complexity across the existing codebase. The AI assistants cannot hel
 p us with this task yet\, and we should discuss manual methods and tools t
 hat can help us. The effectiveness of the proposed ideas will be demonstra
 ted by applying them to large projects from different business areas.
DTSTAMP:20261116T105843Z
LOCATION:Auditorium
SUMMARY:Modern art of simplifying python projects by distributing complexit
 y. - Maxim Danilov
URL:https://pretalx.evolutio.pt/pycon-portugal-2024/talk/NFLRHA/
END:VEVENT
